'''Chroma Fire Bear''' is a [[Chroma Fire Pets|Chroma Fire Pet]] that is obtainable by hatching it from the [[Common Egg|common egg]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
Chroma Fire Bear has the same appearance as the [[Fire Bear]], but the pet alternates colors chromatically.
== Trivia ==

*This pet is the [[Chroma Fire Pets|chroma]] variant of [[Fire Bear]], and the [[Chroma Fire Pets|chroma fire]] variant of [[Bear]].
